---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'What\'s Your Spending Pattern? — Free Spending Personality Quiz';
const description = 'Take this free 10-question quiz to discover your spending personality type. Are you a Planner, Minimalist, Spontaneous Spender, or Balanced Spender? No signup required.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "WebApplication",
      "name": "Spending Pattern Quiz",
      "url": "https://gettidyflow.com/tools/spending-pattern-quiz",
      "applicationCategory": "FinanceApplication",
      "operatingSystem": "Any",
      "offers": { "@type": "Offer", "price": "0", "priceCurrency": "USD" },
      "description": description
    })} />
  </Fragment>

  <section class="tool-hero">
    <div class="tool-hero-inner">
      <span class="tool-badge">Free Tool — No Signup Required</span>
      <h1>What's Your <span class="gradient-text">Spending Pattern</span>?</h1>
      <p class="tool-subtitle">Answer 10 quick questions to uncover your spending personality. Understanding how you spend is the first step to mastering your money.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tool-app">
    <div class="tool-container">
      <!-- Quiz Card -->
      <div class="quiz-card" id="quiz-card">
        <div class="progress-bar-container">
          <div class="progress-bar" id="progress-bar"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="progress-text" id="progress-text">Question 1 of 10</p>
        <h2 class="question-text" id="question-text"></h2>
        <div class="options-container" id="options-container"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Results Card (hidden initially) -->
      <div class="result-card-main" id="result-card" style="display:none;">
        <div class="result-type-icon" id="result-icon"></div>
        <h2 class="result-type-name" id="result-type-name"></h2>
        <p class="result-description" id="result-description"></p>

        <div class="result-section">
          <h3>💪 Your Strengths</h3>
          <ul id="result-strengths"></ul>
        </div>

        <div class="result-section">
          <h3>🎯 Areas to Improve</h3>
          <ul id="result-improvements"></ul>
        </div>

        <div class="result-section">
          <h3>🛠️ Recommended Tools</h3>
          <div class="recommended-tools" id="result-tools"></div>
        </div>

        <button class="retake-button" id="retake-button">Retake Quiz</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tool-cta">
    <div class="tool-container">
      <div class="cta-card">
        <h2>Master Your Spending Pattern</h2>
        <p>Understanding your spending personality is the first step. Track your actual spending with our Notion Budget Tracker and see where your money really goes.</p>
        <a href="https://gettidyflow.gumroad.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cta-button">Get the Notion Budget Tracker &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tool-content">
    <div class="tool-container content-narrow">
      <h2>Understanding Your Spending Pattern</h2>
      <p>Everyone has a unique relationship with money. Your spending pattern is shaped by your upbringing, values, emotional triggers, and life experiences. There is no single "correct" way to spend — but understanding your natural tendencies helps you make smarter financial decisions.</p>
      <p>This quiz identifies which of four spending personality types best describes your habits. Once you know your type, you can lean into your strengths and work on your blind spots to build a healthier financial life.</p>

      <h2>The 4 Spending Types</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>The Planner</strong> — Methodical and detail-oriented. Planners track every dollar, love spreadsheets, and rarely make impulse purchases. They thrive on structure and always know exactly where their money goes.</li>
        <li><strong>The Minimalist</strong> — Focused on essentials only. Minimalists spend as little as possible, save aggressively, and find joy in simplicity. They question every purchase and prioritize financial independence above lifestyle.</li>
        <li><strong>The Spontaneous Spender</strong> — Lives in the moment. Spontaneous spenders buy what feels right, enjoy treating themselves and others, and view money as a tool for experiences rather than accumulation.</li>
        <li><strong>The Balanced Spender</strong> — A healthy mix of saving and enjoying. Balanced spenders set budgets but allow room for fun. They save consistently without feeling deprived and adapt their habits as life changes.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How to Change Your Spending Habits</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Track for 30 days first</strong> — Before making any changes, simply record every purchase. Awareness alone shifts behavior.</li>
        <li><strong>Identify your triggers</strong> — Do you spend more when stressed, bored, or celebrating? Recognizing patterns is half the battle.</li>
        <li><strong>Automate your savings</strong> — Move money to savings on payday before you have the chance to spend it.</li>
        <li><strong>Use the 24-hour rule</strong> — For any non-essential purchase over $50, wait 24 hours before buying. Most impulse urges fade.</li>
        <li><strong>Review weekly, not daily</strong> — Checking too often creates anxiety; checking too rarely leads to surprises. Weekly reviews hit the sweet spot.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Related Tools</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/tools/budget-calculator">50/30/20 Budget Calculator</a> — Split your income into needs, wants, and savings</li>
        <li><a href="/tools/50-30-20-calculator">50/30/20 Rule Breakdown</a> — Deep-dive into the budgeting rule</li>
        <li><a href="/tools/subscription-calculator">Subscription Cost Calculator</a> — Find out how much your subscriptions really cost</li>
        <li><a href="/tools/savings-goal-calculator">Savings Goal Calculator</a> — Plan how long it takes to reach your savings target</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <details>
        <summary>Is there a "best" spending personality type?</summary>
        <p>No. Each type has strengths and weaknesses. The Balanced Spender may seem ideal, but Planners build wealth faster and Minimalists achieve financial independence sooner. The best type is the one that aligns with your goals and keeps you financially healthy.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can my spending type change over time?</summary>
        <p>Absolutely. Major life events — a new job, marriage, having kids, or a financial setback — can shift your spending personality. Retake this quiz every 6-12 months to see how your habits evolve.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How accurate is this quiz?</summary>
        <p>This quiz is a self-assessment tool designed to give you a general understanding of your spending tendencies. It is not a clinical financial evaluation. Use the results as a starting point for self-reflection, not as a definitive diagnosis.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>I got Spontaneous Spender. Does that mean I'm bad with money?</summary>
        <p>Not at all. Spontaneous spenders often have rich life experiences and generous relationships. The key is adding some structure — like automated savings and spending limits — so your spontaneity does not derail your long-term goals.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What should I do after taking the quiz?</summary>
        <p>Start by reading your personalized recommendations. Then try tracking your spending for one month using a <a href="/tools/budget-calculator">budget calculator</a> or our Notion Budget Tracker. Comparing your actual spending against your personality type reveals actionable insights.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .tool-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%);
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .tool-hero-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .tool-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .tool-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffd6e0, #ffecd2);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }
  .tool-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    opacity: 0.92;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tool-app {
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    background: #f8f9fb;
  }
  .tool-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Quiz Card */
  .quiz-card {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }
  .progress-bar-container {
    width: 100%;
    height: 8px;
    background: #f0f0f5;
    border-radius: 999px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .progress-bar {
    height: 100%;
    width: 10%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f093fb, #f5576c);
    border-radius: 999px;
    transition: width 0.4s ease;
  }
  .progress-text {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #999;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .question-text {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1a2e;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .options-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .option-button {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: #f8f9fb;
    border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #1a1a2e;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    font-family: inherit;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .option-button:hover {
    border-color: #f093fb;
    background: #fef0f8;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(240,147,251,0.15);
  }
  .option-button:active {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  .option-button .option-label {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1.75rem;
    height: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1.75rem;
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb, #f5576c);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-right: 0.75rem;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  /* Results Card */
  .result-card-main {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .result-type-icon {
    font-size: 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .result-type-name {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb, #f5576c);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }
  .result-description {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #555;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .result-section {
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    background: #f8f9fb;
    border-radius: 12px;
